# vms42_state_normalizer_hidden_join.py AI Check

- [ ] Hidden join accepts only candidate bundles and reads hidden dictionary/acceptable sets internally.
- [ ] Public manifest hash mismatch fails before hidden evaluation.
- [ ] Candidate input hash mismatch fails before evaluation.
